{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Write batches of records in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, for an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to send."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatch"],"title":"Encoding batches","anchor":"Encoding-batches"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorEncodingError"],"title":"Records left out","anchor":"Records-left-out"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" is the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" for a self-hosted TraffluentCollector’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/v1\/batches"},{"type":"text","text":". Give it to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations"},{"type":"text","text":") as its encoder,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and pass the collector’s API key to the destination as an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Authorization: Bearer"},{"type":"text","text":" header field."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The body is JSON: one object per record, with the record’s identifier (which a redelivered record"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps), the event’s name, its timestamp, whether it is redelivered, its properties and its context."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Properties are read from the event’s "},{"code":"Encodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" form, which "},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" derives, through the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event’s schema in the "},{"code":"TrackingPlan","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the encoder is made with. The context holds the standard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context keys the record has values for, its session and sample rate, and its trace context. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" value is written only while the record reveals it; once redacted, a "},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property is left out, and an array’s element, or a value inside a type the plan can’t map, is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A record the encoder can’t write is left out and the rest of the batch is sent: one whose event and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version the plan doesn’t describe, one whose event isn’t "},{"code":"Encodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", one holding a value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"JSON can’t, such as a NaN, and one whose timestamp has no ISO 8601 form (NaN, infinite, or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than "},{"code":"Int64.max","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" milliseconds from 1970). "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" returns each record left out"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a "},{"code":"SkippedRecord","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"), which the destination logs and reports on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its "},{"code":"dropReports","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". When no record of a batch can be written, the destination sends nothing."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/batch(of:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" returns the same body and skipped records without a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To send to a server of your own format, write a ","type":"text"},{"code":"BatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of your own. To send to PostHog,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostHogBatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (module ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostHogEncoding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import CollectorEncoding","import HTTPDestinations","import TrackingPlans","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()","let encoder = CollectorBatchEncoder(plan: plan)","let collector = HTTPDestination(","    endpoint: collectorURL,  \/\/ https:\/\/collector.example.com\/v1\/batches","    headerFields: [.authorization: \"Bearer \\(apiKey)\"],","    encoder: encoder)","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: collector)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers sending to the collector beside the other destinations."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"CollectorEncoding","modules":[{"name":"CollectorEncoding"}],"externalID":"CollectorEncoding","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/collectorencoding"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"references":{"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Choosing Destinations","type":"text"}],"title":"Choosing Destinations","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"},"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding/CollectorBatchEncoder/requests(for:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding\/collectorbatchencoder\/requests(for:)","type":"topic","title":"requests(for:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The one request carrying ","type":"text"},{"code":"batch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, and the records","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"left out of it.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requests","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchRequests","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations13BatchRequestsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"CollectorEncodingError","preciseIdentifier":"s:17